    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84080" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνῖγος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>choking, stifling,</i> of the effects of heat, and so
				<i>stifling heat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				726
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1091
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.87
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἡλίῳ τε καὶ πνίγει,
				διὰ καύματός τε καὶ πνίγους,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				422c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				621a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνίγους ὄντος τὰ νῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					625b
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔν γε χειμῶσιν καὶ πνίγεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phlb.</u>
					26a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in the
			Parabasis of the 
				Att.
			 Comedy, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακρόν</span>
			, because spoken at one breath, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				659
			</span></i>.</div>
